====================================================================================
W303 -- does W138's convention question reach conjugate heat transfer?
====================================================================================
`assemble_seam`'s own note says a fluid-solid seam usually has both
sides positive in ONE shared direction, so the well-posed condition is
their DIFFERENCE and adding them makes L4/E7/passivity report the
convention. It says it of MECH. Both THERM sides here return heat INTO
THE SOLID, which is the same shape.

